 language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">인증샷</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"> </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; unicode-bidi: embed; DIRECTION: ltr; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; language: ko\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 35pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&#10113; 암석 위에 크기 비교할 수 있도록 자</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">동전</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">볼펜</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\">올려놓고 찍기</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&#10114; 파일명을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><U>조-암석명(예:1조-화강암) 으로 해서 </U></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: #3333cc; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; language: en-US; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 5; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><A href=\"mailto:jj-y-m@daum.net\"><U><FONT color=#0066cc>jj-y-m@daum.net</FONT></U></A></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 35pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">메일보내기</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 35pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">조를 짜서 이렇게 유의사항과 역할을 준 뒤 태블릿을 각 조당 한 대씩 배부 한 시간 동안 광합성을 하면서 학교 한 바퀴 돌면 한 시간이 후딱 지나갑니다.</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 35pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">찍은 사진은 칼라 출력해서 조별로 나눠준뒤 보고서에 붙이라고 했습니다.</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 디지영이체M; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 35pt; language: ko; mso-ascii-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-fareast-font-family: 디지영이체M; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; text-combine: letters\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">대부분 학교에 편마암(정원석), 화강암(학교간판, 중앙현관), 운동장(</SPAN></SPAN>석영, 장석, 백운모), 계단(인조대리석-염산반응), 운좋으면 대리석 조각 이 있는것 같아요... 가볍게 수업해보는 것도 괜찮을 듯 합니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/241F1B35534D393F2A\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20140325_091248.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_241F1B35534D393F2A385B\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22601E34534D39882B\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20140325_085913.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_22601E34534D39882B1363\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/253F1034534D398A36\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"20140325_084606.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"768\"  id=\"A_253F1034534D398A368B62\"/></P>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
